## Architecture

```
App.tsx
  └── Dashboard.tsx (top nav bar)
        ├── GamesHub.tsx (matchups, spreads, totals)
        ├── PropBettingCenter.tsx (props table + BettingSlip)
        ├── DFSOptimizer.tsx (main orchestrator)
        │     ├── optimizer/BuildControlBar.tsx (merged build+control+optimize)
        │     ├── optimizer/GameSlate.tsx (game context cards)
        │     ├── optimizer/PlayerTable.tsx (dense data grid + exposure)
        │     ├── optimizer/TeamStacksTab.tsx (team selection per stack size)
        │     ├── optimizer/StackExposureTab.tsx (global stack type exposure)
        │     ├── optimizer/TeamCombosTab.tsx (combination generator)
        │     ├── optimizer/AdvancedQuantTab.tsx (Monte Carlo, Kelly, GARCH)
        │     ├── optimizer/MyEntriesTab.tsx (API-persisted favorites)
        │     ├── optimizer/Sidebar.tsx (compact results/favorites panel)
        │     └── LineupsTab.tsx (generated lineups display)
        ├── HowToUse.tsx
        └── AccountSettings.tsx
```

### Optimization Pipeline
```
TeamStacksTab (team+stack selections)
  + StackExposureTab (global exposure per type)
  + TeamExposures (per-team min/max %)        ◄── Gap A: NOT YET WIRED
  ↓
useOptimizer.ts (builds request)
  ↓
dfs-api.ts → POST /api/optimize
  ↓
server/index.js (routes to Python)
  ↓
makrov_cli_adapter.py
  ├── Parses teamSelections → per-stack-size teams
  ├── Distributes lineups across stack sizes
  ├── For each stack_type × team: calls optimize_single_lineup_pulp()
  └── PuLP solver enforces: ≥ stack_size players from target team
```

## Conventions
- Dark theme CSS vars: `--dfs-bg-primary`, `--dfs-bg-secondary`, `--dfs-accent`, `--dfs-border`, `--dfs-text-primary`, `--dfs-text-secondary`, `--dfs-text-muted`, `--dfs-bg-hover`, `--dfs-bg-tertiary`
- Icons: lucide-react (≤ 3.5 icon sizes)
- UI primitives: shadcn/ui in `./ui/`
- Font sizes: 11px table data, 12px labels, 13px headers
- Row heights: 28-30px data tables, 32px tab bars
- Python optimizer: PuLP for ILP, called via subprocess from Node server
- All changes must compile: `cd web_optimizer/client && npx vite build`
